  "title": "DropdownMenu",
  "navigationTitle": "",
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "A menu of actions that opens from a button, like the actions of an entry in the dashboard."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentExampleBlock",
      "_id": "3JmLPHOUBCfo61DI1GXYrRGj5pi",
      "example": "DropdownMenu"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Checkbox and radio items"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "checkbox-and-radio-items"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "A menu can hold options as well: a checkbox item toggles one, a radio group picks one of several. Unlike actions they keep the menu open when selected."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentExampleBlock",
      "_id": "3JmLPFlDXwWtggVzVCg0diygEes",
      "example": "DropdownMenuSelection"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Props"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "props"
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentPropsBlock",
      "_id": "3JmLPE6mr1YAuDm6oaSLcxKagST",
      "component": "DropdownMenu"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Accessibility"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "accessibility"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "The menu opens with Enter, Space or the arrow keys, the arrow keys move through its items and typing jumps to a matching item. Escape closes it and returns focus to the trigger."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
